Let $f$, $g$, and $h$ be linearly independent functions defined for all real numbers, and construct three signals by sampling the values of the functions at the integers:$\begin{matrix}
      {u_{k} = f(k),} & & {v_{k} = g(k)} & & {w_{k} = h(k)}
